# Crypto Desk - environment variables (example).
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (which is git-ignored) ONLY if you want to trade live.
# Paper mode needs no keys at all.
#
# Security checklist for your Binance API key:
#   * Enable "Reading" and "Spot & Margin Trading" ONLY.
#   * NEVER enable "Withdrawals", "Universal Transfer", Futures or Margin.
#   * Restrict the key to your own IP address.
#   * Optionally restrict it to a symbol whitelist and copy the same list into
#     [watcher] allowed_symbols in config.toml.
#   * Never commit, paste, screenshot or share this file.
#
# Real environment variables override values in this file.

BINANCE_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
BINANCE_API_SECRET=your_api_secret_here
